        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Adapt. Destroy.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Slug Survival</strong>, a <strong>fast, chaotic top-down arena shooter</strong> where every second counts. <br>Face off against bio-engineered slugs that <strong>learn, adapt, and strike harder</strong> with every wave.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/8ce49c325133987328eba16a12ae703d.avif?t=1786345032\" width=920 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move fast and <strong>blast through relentless slug swarms</strong> that grow <strong>faster, meaner, and more unpredictable</strong> each round. Keep moving, keep firing or get overrun. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/c472a5035a2a41a238d739cdfee1fb23.poster.avif?t=1786345032\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/c472a5035a2a41a238d739cdfee1fb23.webm?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/c472a5035a2a41a238d739cdfee1fb23.mp4?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/ae6d476a9000af4f7378b35ad43f6334.poster.avif?t=1786345032\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/ae6d476a9000af4f7378b35ad43f6334.webm?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/ae6d476a9000af4f7378b35ad43f6334.mp4?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/2bb1d349616537fb8ca18cfbd2e4a7d1.avif?t=1786345032\" width=920 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect power-ups to <strong>boost your firepower</strong> and unlock devastating multi-shot upgrades.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/5674c217ed2f1c46614290971af72189.poster.avif?t=1786345032\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/5674c217ed2f1c46614290971af72189.webm?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/5674c217ed2f1c46614290971af72189.mp4?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack your boosts to unleash up to <strong>five shots at once</strong>, melting everything in your path. <br>Every pickup is a step toward survival or total annihilation.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/a23748df3e806a6d447429c602e76fb7.avif?t=1786345032\" width=920 height=120 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face powerful, tougher, smarter, and far more dangerous <strong>boss slugs</strong> that get even tougher at key milestones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/189ba4fa134540a831fcf1bbf69af8ae.poster.avif?t=1786345032\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/189ba4fa134540a831fcf1bbf69af8ae.webm?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/189ba4fa134540a831fcf1bbf69af8ae.mp4?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat them</strong> to earn <strong>massive bonuses</strong>, unlock <strong>game-changing upgrades</strong>, and push your survival to the limit.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/195a6807e431e9a36d0424df896a094a.avif?t=1786345032\" width=920 height=120 /></span><br>Compete for the top spot and show off your survival skills. Earn higher scores, survive longer, and cement your name among the best Slug Slayers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/860acd6496f9046f69decd67ca3395f9.poster.avif?t=1786345032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/860acd6496f9046f69decd67ca3395f9.webm?t=1786345032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
